    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477600/extras/13455160d73fb2e651329b7a28d7e826.poster.avif?t=1746559410\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477600/extras/13455160d73fb2e651329b7a28d7e826.webm?t=1746559410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477600/extras/13455160d73fb2e651329b7a28d7e826.mp4?t=1746559410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robot Zizzy lives inside a TV screen, in a neon 2D world. One day he discovers that its inhabitants are missing. We are going to find out that the evil robot Magnus has kidnapped them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a long journey: you will break out of the TV into 3D world to return the inhabitants, defeat the kidnapper and find out the whole truth. On the way we will meet new friends, enemies and many unusual puzzles. You will walk across the neon city through the TVs, move and break them to restore balance in the two worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477600/extras/faaf9119df8c5959b52260319e05358c.poster.avif?t=1746559410\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477600/extras/faaf9119df8c5959b52260319e05358c.webm?t=1746559410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477600/extras/faaf9119df8c5959b52260319e05358c.mp4?t=1746559410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key gameplay feature: You have to move the TVs in the 3D world to make one big level from the screens. You will be able to jump inside the screen and complete the level!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477600/extras/13455160d73fb2e651329b7a28d7e826.poster.avif?t=1746559410\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477600/extras/13455160d73fb2e651329b7a28d7e826.webm?t=1746559410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477600/extras/13455160d73fb2e651329b7a28d7e826.mp4?t=1746559410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robot Zizzy lives inside a TV screen, in a neon 2D world. One day he discovers that its inhabitants are missing. We are going to find out that the evil robot Magnus has kidnapped them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a long journey: you will break out of the TV into 3D world to return the inhabitants, defeat the kidnapper and find out the whole truth. On the way we will meet new friends, enemies and many unusual puzzles. You will walk across the neon city through the TVs, move and break them to restore balance in the two worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477600/extras/faaf9119df8c5959b52260319e05358c.poster.avif?t=1746559410\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477600/extras/faaf9119df8c5959b52260319e05358c.webm?t=1746559410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477600/extras/faaf9119df8c5959b52260319e05358c.mp4?t=1746559410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key gameplay feature: You have to move the TVs in the 3D world to make one big level from the screens. You will be able to jump inside the screen and complete the level!</p>",
    "short_description": "Escape from a flat 2D TV screen and discover a 3D world in this story-driven puzzle game! Embark on a journey between dimensions, walk across the neon city, through the screens full of unexpected puzzles.",
